  "body": "## Summary\n\nReplaces the mint-and-store-JWT pattern with cookie-only delegation. auth.romaine.life owns the session via a \\`.romaine.life\\`-scoped cookie that the browser auto-attaches on every request to workout.romaine.life. The backend forwards the cookie to auth.romaine.life's \\`/api/auth/get-session\\` on each request (cached 60s) and gates on the returned role claim.\n\n## Why now\n\nTank-operator's mint-local-JWT pattern was justified for tank-operator (it bundles per-user profile data into the token, making reads self-contained). For kill-me there's nothing equivalent to bundle — the JWT just re-signed the same \\`{sub, email, name, role}\\` auth.romaine.life already issues. The per-app KV secret + role assignments + localStorage token were all dead weight.\n\nPer [tank-operator/docs/quality-timeframes.md](https://github.com/nelsong6/tank-operator/blob/main/docs/quality-timeframes.md): *\"the durable data model or state ownership is explicit\"* and *\"local UI state that can contradict durable state\"* — auth.romaine.life is the durable owner; the localStorage JWT was shadow state with TTL drift.\n\n**Also fixes the prod-503 state**: pod no longer reads \\`kill-me-jwt-signing-secret\\`, so the workload-identity-scope-on-renamed-secret problem (which was blocked by the kill-me tfstate lock from a prior failed apply) is moot.\n\n## Pattern\n\n- **Backend** ([backend/auth.js](backend/auth.js)): \\`createRequireAuth()\\` returns middleware that:\n  1. Reads \\`req.headers.cookie\\`\n  2. Looks up the cookie in a 60s in-process cache; on miss, calls \\`auth.romaine.life/api/auth/get-session\\` with the cookie forwarded as the \\`Cookie\\` header\n  3. Caches the result (positive or negative) for 60s\n  4. Gates on \\`role ∈ {admin, user}\\` — \\`pending\\` returns 403\n  5. Attaches \\`req.user = { sub, email, name, role }\\`\n- **Frontend** ([frontend/src/auth/index.js](frontend/src/auth/index.js)): exposes \\`bootstrapAuth()\\` (calls \\`/api/auth/me\\` which is the unauthenticated probe), \\`startLogin()\\` (redirect), \\`logout()\\`. No token storage, no Authorization header.\n- **API calls**: \\`apiFetch\\` sets \\`credentials: 'include'\\` so the cookie attaches; no Bearer header.\n\n## End-to-end deletions\n\n| Deleted | Why |\n|---|---|\n| \\`backend/auth-routes.js\\` | No \\`/api/auth/exchange\\`, no logout endpoint (handled directly via auth.romaine.life) |\n| \\`backend/auth.js\\` HS256 + jose verifier | Backend no longer verifies tokens; just forwards cookie |\n| \\`backend/config.js\\` KV read | No signing secret needed |\n| \\`jose\\` + \\`jsonwebtoken\\` deps | Not used |\n| \\`frontend/src/auth/index.js\\` token dance | localStorage tokens / fetchUpstreamJWT / exchange — all gone |\n| \\`frontend/src/api/client.js\\` Authorization header | Cookie-attached automatically |\n| \\`tofu/keyvault.tf\\` | No per-app signing secret to provision |\n| \\`tofu/identity.tf\\` KV role assignment | Pod doesn't read KV anymore |\n\n## Guard\n\n[scripts/check-removed-msal.mjs](scripts/check-removed-msal.mjs) extended to block reintroduction of: \\`jsonwebtoken\\`, \\`jose\\`, \\`jwt.sign\\`/\\`jwt.verify\\`, \\`createRemoteJWKSet\\`, \\`/api/auth/exchange\\`, \\`localStorage.{get,set,remove}Item('token')\\`, \\`kill-me-jwt-signing-secret\\`.\n\n## Sequencing\n\n1. Merge → backend image rebuilds + ArgoCD rolls → pod boots without trying to read the missing-permission KV secret → \\`workout.romaine.life\\` health 200\n2. Tofu apply on merge destroys the now-unused \\`kill-me-jwt-signing-secret\\` KV secret + the related role assignment. (If the prior tfstate lock from \\`runner@runnervmrw5os 2026-05-16 05:31:06\\` hasn't expired, may need one force-unlock before this apply succeeds.)\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] \\`npm run build\\` (frontend) clean\n- [x] \\`node scripts/check-removed-msal.mjs\\` clean\n- [ ] After image rolls: \\`curl https://workout.romaine.life/health\\` returns 200\n- [ ] Sign in via auth.romaine.life → \\`/api/auth/me\\` returns user object → SPA renders signed-in\n- [ ] Admin writes (log workout, edit cycle day) go through with valid cookie\n- [ ] Sign out → cookie cleared on auth.romaine.life → next \\`/api/auth/me\\` returns null\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
